commercial/**/out/*.mp4

# Promo working files. Cloudflare Pages publishes EVERY file in the project, so
# anything committed under commercial/ becomes a public URL on the domain -
# SCRIPT.md and GEMINI-PROMPTS.md already serve 200 today. Scripts, wardrobe
# notes and the Remotion source are internal; only the rendered output belongs
# on the site, and that lives in media/.
commercial/**/*.md
commercial/**/remotion/src/
commercial/**/remotion/*.mjs
commercial/**/remotion/out/
commercial/media/
